      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Such painful honesty about feeling emptied out so deeply is valid, but it is important to know that this \"hollow\" feeling is often a symptom of overwhelming exhaustion rather than proof of inevitable ruin. Please remember that even when you feel you've only lied to yourself about this, there are specialists trained specifically to untangle situations where standard \"fix-its\" have clearly failed. You do not have to decide if things are too far gone right now; the most important thing you can do for yourself is to stop alone and ask a professional to look at this foundational grief. Healing can sometimes begin only after we admit that our previous attempts have failed.",
